WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.434
It is time to play
"Can You Feel It?"

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:04.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.834
-♪ Can you feel it? ♪

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.067
-But I am going to
need some help.

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.934
She stars in the giant new movie
"The Batman,"

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.300
in theaters and IMAX
this Friday.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.100
Please welcome Zoe Kravitz!

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.100
♪♪

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.400
-♪ Can you feel it? ♪

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:26.868
-Oh, my God.
-I'm scared.

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:28.234
-I know.
Don't even look at that.

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:29.834
That's a standing O
for you, bud.

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:31.234
They love you.
-Hi.

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:34.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's right, Zoe Kravitz.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:37.834
All right, Zoe, here's how --
here's how this works.

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:39.801
We're gonna have
a number of mystery objects

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:41.367
brought out in front of us.

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:44.234
And our job is to guess
what is -- each one is.

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:47.834
The catch is that we have
to figure out by touch alone.

00:00:47.834 --> 00:00:49.868
Since you're our guest,
why don't you go first?

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:51.567
-Great.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:53.601
-Let's see
what your first object is.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:56.501
You'll have 30 seconds
to identify what this is.

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:57.868
All right.
Whenever you're ready.

00:00:57.868 --> 00:01:02.000
-Hey, now, hey.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.634
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:07.868
[ Cheers ]

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:11.467
♪♪

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:13.000
Oh, God.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.267
Okay.
Can I ask some questions?

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:16.934
-Yeah.
-Is it alive.

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:18.801
-No.
-Stop it.

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:20.133
You're --
You are scaring me.

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:23.167
[ Laughter ]
-No, it's silly.

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:24.434
-Aah!
I'm so scared!

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:29.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:32.367
Aah!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:35.567
-It's nothing.
It's fake dog poop.

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:39.901
-Eww!

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.667
-All right, here we go.
-I really can't.

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:47.067
-Now, I am up here.
Here we go.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:50.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:53.467
-Oh, God.

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.334
Oh, no.

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:56.934
You'll be fine.

00:01:56.934 --> 00:02:00.868
Right?
You'll be fine.

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:02.467
-I just want to
switch the boxes up!

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:04.200
-Who picks this?
This is crazy.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.901
-No, this is all crazy.

00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:07.167
[ Cheers ]

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:10.467
[ Screaming ]

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:11.701
Aah!

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:14.167
I hate this game!
I hate it!

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:16.167
I touched this!
Whatever it was.

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.100
I don't know what it is.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.467
-Oh, no.

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:20.934
-Oh, don't say that to me.
-I'm sorry.

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:22.734
-Don't say that to me.
-No, you're fine, you're fine.

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.033
-Oof! It's like something --
-Oh, God.

00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:26.934
Oh.
-Aah!

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:30.400
-I'm scared for you.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.734
[ Screaming ]

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:34.300
-It's wet! It's wet!
It's so wet, it's disgusting!

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.501 --> 00:02:38.033
Ugh! It's so gross.
I'm gonna throw up.

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:39.634
I swear, I'm gonna throw up
and get sick.

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:43.467
It's cold, and it's wet,
and something licked me, maybe.

00:02:43.467 --> 00:02:45.601
Is it a cat?
Aah!

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:48.434
I can't do it!
I'm freaking out right now!

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:50.400
Can I go over on this side?
-Yeah.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.934
[ Screaming ]

00:02:51.934 --> 00:02:53.667
-Something else licked me!
This is so weird!

00:02:53.667 --> 00:02:55.000
I hate this game.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.834
Oh, God.
I'm just gonna touch it.

00:02:56.834 --> 00:02:58.501
[ Screaming ]

00:02:58.501 --> 00:02:59.868
I don't know what it is!
I can't do it!

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:01.968
What is it?!
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:03.634
-It's popsicles.
-What?!

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:06.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:06.601 --> 00:03:09.367
It felt like something
was licking me.

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:11.667
It felt like something
was moving and licking me.

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:13.300
It was so gross.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.467
-It's crazy what our minds do.
-Right?

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:17.167
Also, you didn't help,
either, going "Oh, no."

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:18.901
-I know, I'm sorry.
Isn't that the game?

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:20.734
-Yeah, it is.
Zoe, here you go.

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:21.834
-Okay.
-Good luck.

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.834
-Thanks.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.300
Jimmy...

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.100
Ohh!
-[ Chuckles ]

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.734
-I'm brave.
I'm cool, and I'm brave.

00:03:32.734 --> 00:03:33.767
-Right?
-And I'm cool.

00:03:33.767 --> 00:03:35.100
-Yeah, you can do it.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:39.601
-Aah!
I touched it.

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:40.968
What is it?
I have no -- what is it?

00:03:40.968 --> 00:03:42.501
-No, just try it again,
try it again.

00:03:42.501 --> 00:03:44.234
Oh, no!
-Stop it!

00:03:44.234 --> 00:03:47.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.033 --> 00:03:50.000
A turtle?
-No. But not bad.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.400
-Really?
-It's a honeycomb.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.634
With a fake bee.
A honeycomb.

00:03:53.634 --> 00:03:54.834
-Oh.
[ Cheers ]

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:57.200
That's not a turtle.
-No, it's not a turtle.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.400
I didn't know how long
I still wanted to act.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.501
How many more boxes do we have?
Because I'm freaking out.

00:04:02.501 --> 00:04:05.601
All right.
[ Breathes deeply ]

00:04:05.601 --> 00:04:07.300
All right.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:10.133
-Oh, what is --
What is that?

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:13.067
[ Audience groaning ]

00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:14.434
-I don't know what that is.

00:04:14.434 --> 00:04:16.133
-Well, I know what that is,
and that's the sound

00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:17.367
of everyone going, "Ugh."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.367 --> 00:04:19.901
-It's the sound of us
not knowing what it is.

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:21.667
-All right.

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:25.334
♪♪

00:04:25.334 --> 00:04:33.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.100
-I don't know what that is,
but it --

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.133
Oh, I don't like it.

00:04:37.133 --> 00:04:38.934
I don't like that.

00:04:38.934 --> 00:04:44.634
♪♪

00:04:44.634 --> 00:04:47.267
Ugh!

00:04:47.267 --> 00:04:48.734
You're close!
You're close.

00:04:48.734 --> 00:04:50.234
Aah! You're close!

00:04:50.234 --> 00:04:52.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.133 --> 00:04:58.200
♪♪

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:03.501
Oh.

00:05:03.501 --> 00:05:07.667
Ugh.
Ugh.

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:08.868
-Is that -- I have no idea.

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:10.834
Is that a turtle?
Is it a turtle?

00:05:10.834 --> 00:05:11.934
[ Buzzer ]
Is it a turtle?

00:05:11.934 --> 00:05:13.734
[ Laughs ]
What if we keep guessing turtle?

00:05:13.734 --> 00:05:15.267
-It's only turtles.

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:16.267
-Ohh!
-What is it?

00:05:16.267 --> 00:05:17.167
-What is it?!
-What is it?

00:05:17.167 --> 00:05:19.434
-What...is it?

00:05:19.434 --> 00:05:20.667
[ Screaming ]

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:21.934
What is that?!

00:05:21.934 --> 00:05:24.334
-What is it?!
What was that?!

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:26.567
-What is it?
-What is it?!

00:05:26.567 --> 00:05:29.267
What is that?!
-What?

00:05:29.267 --> 00:05:30.634
Why would I touch that?
-Is that a clam?

00:05:30.634 --> 00:05:32.234
-Is that a clam?
-Yes.

00:05:32.234 --> 00:05:34.734
-Oh, my God darn it.
-Oh.

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:38.834
-Get it absolutely out of here.

00:05:38.834 --> 00:05:41.467
All right.
Zoe, it's our last round.

00:05:41.467 --> 00:05:43.634
