-I don't want to!

00:06:01.734 --> 00:06:02.734
-I don't wanna!

00:06:02.734 --> 00:06:03.734
I want to go this way.
-This way?

00:06:03.734 --> 00:06:04.968
-Yeah.

00:06:04.968 --> 00:06:06.634
